(
    title: "London Blitz",
    developer: Some("William J. Sheppard, Rebecca Heineman"),
    description: Some("You are a Royal Engineer working the London Blitz, sent out to clear your sector of the bombs that fell without going off. A street map flashes up where bombs have been reported and you plan a route to one, then walk the streets in first person until you are standing on it. Every bomb presents three coloured sliding bars and a set of indicator lights to read before you commit, and the job ends one of three ways: promotion to Captain, dismissal for incompetence, or a posthumous Victoria Cross."),
